	file = {Full Text PDF:/Users/pierrewalker/Zotero/storage/YUB8FGJV/Kim et al. - 2008 - Organic solvent dispersion of poly(3,4-ethylenedioxythiophene) with the use of polymeric ionic liqui.pdf:application/pdf;Snapshot:/Users/pierrewalker/Zotero/storage/EE8TSY4P/pola.html:text/html},
